  "description": "A partner workout: a 400 m run, 2 rounds of 44 dumbbell front squats, floor presses and hang clean and jerks, a 1,979 m row, 2 rounds of 44 dumbbell deadlifts, bent-over rows and lunges, then a 400 m run, with 50/35 lb dumbbells. Honours Pope County Deputy Sheriff Josh Owen, killed on a domestic violence call in Minnesota in 2023. Run together and split the rest; solo, halve the reps.",
